    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Our team represented CIME at the International Meeting for Simulation in Healthcare (IMSH) in San Diego. The event brought together simulation enthusiasts, researchers, and industry experts from around the globe to share knowledge, innovations, and best practices in healthcare simulation. The 24th IMSH was a record-setter with nearly 4,300 attendees and 142 companies representing 19 countries!",
